{"repositoryId":998597311,"availability":"available","full":"Mattbusel/Every-Other-Token","name":"Every-Other-Token","description":"Rust CLI and web UI that intercepts an LLM token stream live: per-token confidence and perplexity, on-the-fly token mutation, provider and A/B prompt comparison, replay and heatmap export. OpenAI and Anthropic.","category":"AI & machine learning","language":"Rust","stars":26,"forks":1,"created":"2025-06-09T00:03:05Z","updated":"2026-10-15T07:45:46Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://mattbusel.github.io/Every-Other-Token/","topics":["anthropic","cli","interpretability","llm","llm-interpretability","logprobs","openai","perplexity","prompt-engineering","red-teaming","rust","streaming","visualization"],"demo":"https://mattbusel.github.io/Every-Other-Token/","color":"#302e55","ink":"#dbd2ff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-17T03:00:31.605Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-17T03:00:31.605Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-17T03:00:31.605Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-17T03:00:31.605Z","stars":26,"forks":1}],"technologies":["Rust"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Try it in your browser, no install and no API key: every-other-token.vercel.app/play. Type a prompt and watch every other token come out reversed.","every-other-token is a free LLM token stream viewer and interceptor for the command line and the browser. It sits on the live stream from OpenAI, Anthropic, Gemini, OpenRouter or a model on your own machine (Ollama, llama.cpp, vLLM, LM Studio), shows the confidence and perplexity of each token from the logprobs, and can rewrite every other token (or any fraction) as it arrives. A built-in mock provider lets you try all of it with no API key.","Who it's for: anyone curious how language models pick their words, plus people doing LLM interpretability research, red-teaming and prompt engineering."],"features":[],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Mattbusel/Every-Other-Token/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"42bcdc4d4f7126c1